<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of European Cup matches</p>
<p>played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Pool A</p>
<p>In Treviso: </p>
<p>Treviso 27 (Italy) Bath (England) 50 (halftime 8-28)</p>
<p>Scorers: </p>
<p>Treviso - Tries: Ivan Francescato, Alessandro Troncon, Pier</p>
<p>Donati, Francesco Mazzariol. Conversions: Mazzariol (2).</p>
<p>Penalty: Mazzariol.</p>
<p>Bath - Tries: Mike Catt (4), Adedayo Adebayo (2), Dave</p>
<p>Hilton. Conversions: Catt (5), C.Harrison. Penalty: Catt.</p>
<p>Pool B</p>
<p>In Leicester: </p>
<p>Leicester (England) 25 Llaneli (Wales) 16 (halftime 16-9)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Leicester - Tries: B.Drake, Leon Lloyd, A.Healey,</p>
<p>G.Rowntree. Conversions: Rob Liley (3). Penalty: Liley.</p>
<p>Llanelli - Tries: M.Wintle. Conversions: Frano Botica.</p>
<p>Penalties: Botica (2). Dropped goals: Botica.</p>
<p>Attendance: 11,006</p>
<p>In Dublin: </p>
<p>Leinster (Ireland) 25 Pau (France) 23 (16-15)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Leinster - Tries: Kurt McQullkin. Penalties: Alan McGowan 6.</p>
<p>Conversion: McGowan</p>
<p>Pau - Tries: David Aucagne, Christophe Paille, Sebastian</p>
<p>Claverie. Penalties: Aucagne (2). Conversion: Aucagne.</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,000</p>
<p>Pool C</p>
<p>In London: </p>
<p>Harlequins (England) 56 Caledonia (Scotland) 35 (20-16)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Harlequins - Jim Staples (3), Jamie Williams (2), Darren</p>
<p>O'Leary (2), Paul Challinor, Robbie Paul. Conversions: Will</p>
<p>Carling (4). Penalty: Carling</p>
<p>Caledonia - Tries: David McIvor (2), Jonathan Newton,</p>
<p>Officer. Conversions: Rob Shepherd (3). Penalties: Shepherd (3).</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,751</p>
<p>In Belfast: </p>
<p>Ulster (Ireland) 6 Brive (France) 17 (6-5)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ulster - Penalty: David Humphreys. Dropped goal: Humphreys.</p>
<p>Brive - Tries: Carrat, Duboisset, Viars. Conversion: Paillat</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,500</p>
<p>Pool D</p>
<p>In Toulouse: </p>
<p>Toulouse (France) 60 Munster (Ireland) 19 (17-9)</p>
<p>Scorers: </p>
<p>Toulouse - Tries: Michel Marfaing (3), Emile N'tamack (2),</p>
<p>Christian Califano (2), David Berty, Stephane Ougier.</p>
<p>Conversions: Christophe Deylaud (6). Penalty: Deylaud.</p>
<p>Munster - Try: David Corkery. Penalties: Killian Keane (4).</p>
<p>Conversion: Keane.</p>
<p>Attendance: 14,000</p>
<p>In Milan: </p>
<p>Milan (Italy) 23 Wasps (England) 33 (16-12)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Milan - Tries: Fabio Gomez, Marcello Cuttitta. Conversions:</p>
<p>Diego Dominguez (2). Penalties: Dominguez (3).</p>
<p>Wasps - Lawrence Dallaglio, Paul Simpson (2), Alex King.</p>
<p>Conversions: Jon Ufton (2). Penalties: Ufton (2). Dropped goal:</p>
<p>King.</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,200</p>
<p>Pool A</p>
<p>In Dax: </p>
<p>Dax (France) 22 Pontypridd (Wales) 18 (7-12)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Dax - Try: Hugo Mola. Conversion: Richard Dourthe. Penalties: Dourthe (5)</p>
<p>Pontypridd - Penalties: Neil Jenkins (6)</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
